ulf: The Making of an American Sea","a":["Jack E. Davis"],"y":2018,"s":"Nature & Environment","w":[["pulitzer-prize","History",2018,"winner"],["kirkus-prize","Nonfiction",2017,"winner"],["national-book-critics-circle-awards","Nonfiction",2017,"finalist"],["andrew-carnegie-medals","Nonfiction",2018,"longlist"]],"i":113},{"t":"To Be a Machine: Adventures Among Cyborgs, Utopians, Hackers, and the Futurists Solving the Modest Problem of Death","a":["Mark O'Connell"],"y":2017,"s":"Technology","w":[["wellcome-book-prize","Nonfiction",2018,"winner"],["baillie-gifford-prize","Non-Fiction",2017,"finalist"],["royal-society-science-book-prize","Science Book Prize",2017,"shortlist"],["ryszard-kapuscinski-award","Literary Reportage",2021,"longlist"]],"i":114},{"t":"Red Famine: Stalin's War on Ukraine","a":["Anne Applebaum"],"y":2017,"s":"History","w":[["lionel-gelber-prize","International Affairs",2018,"winner"],["duff-cooper-prize","History, Biography & Political Science",2017,"winner"],["cundill-history-prize","History",2018,"finalist"],["pen-hessell-tiltman-prize","Historical Nonfiction",2018,"shortlist"]],"i":115},{"t":"Capital in the Twenty-First Century","a":["Thomas Piketty"],"y":2017,"s":"Business & Economics","w":[["arthur-ross-book-award","International Affairs",2015,"winner"],["prose-awards","Economics",2015,"winner"],["ft-business-book-of-the-year","Business Book of the Year",2014,"winner"],["kirkus-prize","Nonfiction",2014,"finalist"]],"i":116},{"t":"Ravenna: Capital of Empire, Crucible of Europe","a":["Judith Herrin"],"y":2016,"s":"World History","w":[["prose-awards","World History",2021,"winner"],["duff-cooper-prize","History, Biography & Political Science",2020,"winner"],["wolfson-history-prize","History",2022,"shortlist"],["cundill-history-prize","History",2021,"longlist"]],"i":117},{"t":"The Work of the Dead: A Cultural History of Mortal Remains","a":["Thomas W. Laqueur"],"y":2016,"s":"History","w":[["laura-shannon-prize","European Studies",2018,"winner"],["cun